+Get a second opinion from Codex without leaving Claude Code. This plugin lets Claude hand Codex any
+work, including analysis, document review, competing designs or an implementation. Each call declares
+what Codex may write and returns a JSON report of the events the driver observed.
+
+The report helps you inspect the work. Neither a successful exit nor a matching session record proves
+that the requested task succeeded.
